{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "摩訶衍，大乘也。若非此心，安堪乘運。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世人縱云淨土出大乘，不能如上約教甄簡，寧逃混濫，未足决疑。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上化主"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上眷屬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "重罪者，出佛身血、破和合僧、殺阿羅漢、殺父、殺母也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若人能誦持此偈，得三種利益：一得常持諸大乘經首題名字，二得增長淨土信心，三得聞者深信淨土。\n若遇臨終者，高聲誦一返二返，然後勸令念佛。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "云云"}
